  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Elenterius/Biomancy/blob/mc1.20.1/prod/media/v2/text_logo_big.png?raw=true\" alt=\"生體魔法模組標誌\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/424awTDdJJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/920005236645572662?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=&amp;color=5865F2&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felenterius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/support me on Ko--fi-F16061?logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>這是一個融合生物有機科技與魔法的模組，靈感來自將生物操控（生體魔法）、生化龐克與血肉魔法等概念混合而成。本模組試圖站在死靈術等操弄死亡的邪惡技藝對立面，轉而探索生命能量並創造新生。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"forge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/geckolib_vector.svg\" alt=\"geckolib\">&nbsp;</p><hr><h4>暫無指南書</h4><p>目前模組不提供指南書，主要透過<strong>進度系統</strong>和<strong>物品提示</strong>來引導玩法。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">請注意當前提示與進度內容仍在開發中，正式版將會加入完整指引系統。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">若需入門協助可<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fp8rg_cGPYBk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">觀看此教學影片</a>。</p><p><strong>建議搭配JEI查詢合成配方</strong></p><h4><strong>生體魔法擴充模組</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bio-factory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物工廠（與Create聯動）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biobutchers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生化屠夫的饗宴</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbio-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生體魔法饗宴</a></li>\n</ul><h4>模組整合</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex的生物群系</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex的洞穴探險</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui體型模組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔描述</a></li>\n</ul><h4>兼容模組</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力Create</a><ul>\n<li>生物膜可作為<strong>風帆</strong>材料</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dramatic-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">戲劇性門扉</a></li>\n<li>消化器可自動處理所有食物</li>\n<li>含生肉標籤的<strong>食物</strong><br><ul>\n<li>#forge:raw_mutton, #forge:raw_pork, #forge:raw_chicken, #forge:raw_beef, #forge:raw_bacon（如農夫樂事）</li>\n<li>#forge:raw_fishes</li></ul></li>\n</ul><h4>常見問題</h4><h5><strong>會移植到1.21嗎？</strong></h5><p>即將推出™</p><h5><strong>會回溯支援舊版嗎？</strong></h5><p>不會</p><h5><strong>會有Fabric版本嗎？</strong></h5><p>未來會製作Fabric版本</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>製作群</h2><p>特別感謝Discord社群成員提供的寶貴意見與創意</p><h3><strong>核心貢獻者</strong></h3><h3>RhinoW, The Shroome, Kitteh6660, Tyfin, The Shroome, Shorepion, ItsLumine, RuskieThe3rd, ZeoMaddox</h3><p><strong>在地化人員</strong></p><h4>SlimeSB, Quarkrus, Mexwell12, cabaneter</h4><h3><strong>Ko-fi贊助者</strong></h3><h4><strong>PonyPon</strong>, <strong>Tapeworm Tim</strong>, <strong>Spedic</strong>, Adam, Toom, June, da.shyguy, Zeca, pixel_mode</h4><h2>錯誤回報</h2><p>請將問題回報至<a href=\"https://github.com/Elenterius/Biomancy/issues/new/choose\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub問題追蹤系統</a>或<a href=\"https://discord.gg/424awTDdJJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord錯誤回報頻道</a></p><h2>最新動態</h2><p>更多詳細資訊與開發幕後，請加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/424awTDdJJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生體魔法Discord伺服器</a></p>",
